   "html_text": "By the term “God” we understand something than which nothing greater can be thought. [premise] When we think using the term “God”, God is in the understanding. [premise] Therefore, something than which nothing greater can be thought is in the understanding. [by (1) and (2)] What is in the understanding and in reality is greater than what is in the understanding alone. [premise] Therefore, God exists in the understanding and in reality, and not just in the understanding alone. [by (3) and (4)]",
